---
// uvicorn --timeout-keep-alive (default 5 s): a short pause reuses the
// connection, a longer pause finds it closed and pays the handshake again.
const W = 900, H = 280;
---
<figure class="bep1n3">
  <div class="bep1n3-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two clients talking to uvicorn. A client that pauses for less than the 5 second keep-alive timeout reuses the open connection and skips the handshake. A client that pauses longer finds the idle connection closed and pays the handshake again.">
    <text x="500" y="24" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>uvicorn closes an idle connection here</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>uvicorn đóng connection rảnh ở mốc này</tspan></text>
    <text x="500" y="44" text-anchor="middle" class="t">--timeout-keep-alive, 5 s</text>
    <path d="M 500 56 L 500 250" class="lim" />
    <text x="20" y="124" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Pause under 5 s</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nghỉ dưới 5 s</tspan></text>
    <path d="M 207 120 L 353 120" class="ln" />
    <circle cx="200" cy="120" r="7" class="dot" />
    <circle cx="360" cy="120" r="7" class="dot" />
    <text x="200" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>request</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request</tspan></text>
    <text x="360" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>request</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request</tspan></text>
    <text x="360" y="150" text-anchor="middle" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>same pipe, no handshake</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cùng ống, không handshake</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="214" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Pause over 5 s</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nghỉ quá 5 s</tspan></text>
    <path d="M 207 210 L 493 210" class="ln" />
    <path d="M 507 210 L 713 210" class="ln faint" />
    <circle cx="200" cy="210" r="7" class="dot" />
    <circle cx="720" cy="210" r="7" class="dot bad" />
    <text x="200" y="188" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>request</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request</tspan></text>
    <text x="720" y="188" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>request</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request</tspan></text>
    <text x="600" y="236" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>connection already closed</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>connection đã đóng</tspan></text>
    <text x="720" y="260" text-anchor="middle" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>pays the handshake again</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lại trả phí handshake</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The keep-alive timeout decides whether the next request reuses the pipe or builds a new one.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Keep-alive timeout quyết định request kế tiếp dùng lại ống cũ hay phải dựng ống mới.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep1n3 { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep1n3-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep1n3 svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep1n3 text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep1n3 .t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep1n3 .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep1n3 .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep1n3 .lim { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 5 5; fill: none; }
  .bep1n3 .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .bep1n3 .ln.faint { stroke: var(--border); stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .bep1n3 .dot { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep1n3 .dot.bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep1n3 figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
